<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 700 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 700 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 200 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and</p>
<p>500 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - January 8, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity of bills offered - April 9, 1997, October 8, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
